# RPC commands

`docs/rpc-commands.md` is the list of calls. A new or changed `Request.add_class` method, or a notification `method`, is written into that file in the same change.

The entry names the argument letters, the socket, and the reply.

Do not put that rule into `docs/coding-standards-router.md`. That file is a symlink into OLLMchat.
